{#- _lang.html.j2 — the language menu in the global bar of every page (Korean and every other version;
    pipeline/en_site.Intl.menu builds `langs` = [{code, hreflang, label, href, current}] in menu order: 한국어 · English ·
    日本語 · 中文(简体) · 中文(繁體) · Deutsch · Français · Español · Русский, only the versions this build has). A build with
    Korean alone has no menu (no hreflang, no language link anywhere).
    menu(langs, label): a <details>/<summary> — opens and closes without JavaScript (site.js only closes it on an
      outside click, a followed link or Escape: details[data-langmenu]); the summary is a 44px target with a globe
      icon and the current version's name (phones: the icon, the name stays for screen readers; label = the word
      'Language' in the page's language, read before it). Each item links that version's counterpart of this page,
      else its home, and is marked with lang and hreflang (the name written in its own language, like Korea's
      official tourism site); the page's own version carries aria-current. CSS: assets/css/77-lang.css.
    others(langs): the other versions as plain list items (the phone menu panel and the footer). -#}
{% macro menu(langs, label) -%}
{% if langs and langs|length > 1 %}{% set cur = langs|selectattr('current')|first %}<details class="lang-menu" data-langmenu><summary class="lang-btn"><svg class="icon lang-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M3 12h18M12 3c2.4 2.5 3.6 5.5 3.6 9s-1.2 6.5-3.6 9M12 3C9.6 5.5 8.4 8.5 8.4 12s1.2 6.5 3.6 9"/></svg><span class="vh">{{ label }}: </span><span class="lang-cur" lang="{{ cur.hreflang }}">{{ cur.label }}</span></summary><ul class="lang-list">{% for l in langs %}<li><a class="mast-lang" href="{{ l.href }}" hreflang="{{ l.hreflang }}" lang="{{ l.hreflang }}"{% if l.current %} aria-current="true"{% endif %}>{{ l.label }}</a></li>{% endfor %}</ul></details>{% endif %}
{%- endmacro %}

{% macro others(langs) -%}
{% for l in langs or [] if not l.current %}<li><a href="{{ l.href }}" hreflang="{{ l.hreflang }}" lang="{{ l.hreflang }}">{{ l.label }}</a></li>{% endfor %}
{%- endmacro %}
